## 6. Exact handoff

The repository is mathematically cleaner after this review, but the Level I
problem remains open. The strongest newly supported statements are the exact
near-chain geometry/stress bounds and the promoted C53/C-I restoration.
The strongest rejected statements are the mixed-cut pentagon counterexample and
the unproved whole-configuration force-bulk transport. Future work must begin
from the route maps and this report, not from the withdrawn claims.
